  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Selection**: Players receive 5 cards and discard 2. 2. **Vying**: Standard Brag betting follows. Players choose to play 'Blind' (without looking at their chosen 3) or 'See'. 3. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.",
    Player: "1. **Selection**: Players receive 5 cards and discard 2. 2. **Vying**: Standard Brag betting follows. Players choose to play 'Blind' (without looking at their chosen 3) or 'See'. 3. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.",
    objective: 'Win the pot by forming the best three-card hand from the five dealt, or by forcing others to fold.',
